WEBVTT

00:01:29.276 --> 00:01:32.476
Around the world,
there are the same four regrets

00:01:32.476 --> 00:01:35.676
that keep coming up
over and over and over again.

00:01:35.716 --> 00:01:37.836
So what I want to do is just
quickly tell you

00:01:37.876 --> 00:01:39.596
about these four core regrets,

00:01:39.636 --> 00:01:43.596
because I think they reveal something
incredibly important and interesting.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:45.996
So the four core regrets
that I'm going to cover.

00:01:46.036 --> 00:01:48.716
Number one, what I call
foundation regrets.

00:01:48.716 --> 00:01:49.956
Foundation regrets.

00:01:49.956 --> 00:01:52.076
These are people
who regret things like this:

00:01:52.116 --> 00:01:53.476
not saving enough money,

00:01:53.516 --> 00:01:55.756
which would be like, you know,
financial regret,

00:01:55.796 --> 00:01:59.036
not taking care of their health
and not eating right, health regret.

00:01:59.036 --> 00:02:00.236
But they're the same.